  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CONSERVATION OF THE LEATHERBACK TURTLE (Dermochelys coriacea) IN THE MEXICAN PACIFIC 2016-2017</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The recipient will maintain and operate four turtle camps on the four primary leatherback nesting beaches to provide nightly patroling and protection of nesting females and nests, work with local communities to develop support for sea turtle conservation programs, and provide technical and logistical support for secondary leatherback nesting beaches.</narrative>
  </description>
